SQL: SELECT header, COALESCE(dateline,''), COALESCE(source_note,''), body_text FROM document_cache WHERE volume_id=? AND document_id=?
STRICT: \b(corrupt|corruption|bribe|bribery|graft|kickback|embezzlement)\b
TOLERANT: \b(corrupt\w*|brib\w*|graft(s|ing|er|ers|ed)?|kick[\s\-]?backs?|embezzl\w*)\b
TELEGRAPHIC: (corrupt(ed)?\s+(group|text|word|passage|telegram|in transmission))|(group[s]?\s+corrupt)|(text\s+(is\s+)?corrupt)|garble
